  "title": "Toyota Recalls Certain Model Year 2025-2026 Camry Vehicles",
  "summary": "PLANO, Texas (Aug. 6, 2026) — Toyota is conducting a safety recall involving certain MY2025-2026 Camry vehicles. Approximately 508,000 vehicles are involved in the recall for the U.S. The 7-inch combination meter may become blank at startup. This can also deactivate […]",
